  "idea": "Beginner guide to bookmark managers that save tabs across all devices",
  "text": "Speed up your computer and organize your research using this simple browser extension. Beginners frequently open fifty separate tabs for project research, causing browser crashes and painful system slowdowns. Leaving heavy web applications running in background tabs silently consumes gigabytes of your system memory. Install Toby for Chrome to convert cluttered open windows into clean workspace dashboards organized by project. Your laptop runs noticeably faster every day.",
